@amara the woman on the right, she is Asian, leaning forward with one arm slightly raised near her head while looking down toward the camera. The single light source illuminates half of her face while the other side disappears into shadow, creating a dramatic cinematic effect. wearing black bra and underwear

The three women stand very close together, forming a tight triangular composition above the camera.

